  "$doc": "\u00a723.6 ST-4. 'A side broken' is the measured end: the Blue BASE OF FIRE (Blue Company 2, roster slot 1 - CompanyAttack's roles are slot 0 assault, 1 base of fire, 2 reserve; relabelled 2026-11-17, CE-8302) is destroyed within seconds of contact (all 90 slots down by 335 s at GAP 1500 / 335 s at 600), its HQ hears TaskFailed and reads it Black. It dies at ~290 m (335 s), on its way to its 250 m support position (CE-8302 moved that position from 100 m of the posts; this run is unchanged, golden SAME), so it never reports Set and the assault (Blue Company 1, Subordinates.0) is never committed; the reserve (3) waits at its 400 m stand-off, out of reach, for the 900 s deadline. After agg-backend's calibration (CE-8009 R-8005: focused hits, broken men still firing at 0.6) the assault costs Red companies 1 and 2 ten or more men each (Amber), company 3 under ten (Green) - measured 2026-11-16; reverting 5d8a30150 alone restores the old all-Green outcome (R-8332). The census is the HoldArea objective of ObjectiveCensus (a stochastic unit under a physical subject's roster counts its Present). ROWS",
